From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:21:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 56/56] Two views: a gap at the divider, so line numbers are
 never clipped

The right view started right at the divider, and the first digit of
two-digit line numbers was drawn under the left view's edge ("10" showed
as ":0"). The two views now have room on both sides of the divider.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/src/main.rs b/src/main.rs
index 100a2c0..5032929 100644
--- a/src/main.rs
+++ b/src/main.rs
@@ -3630,6 +3630,9 @@ impl Application for App {
                         .push(pane(views::Side::Left))
                         .push(widget::divider::vertical::default())
                         .push(pane(views::Side::Right))
+                        // Room on both sides of the divider, so the right view's line numbers
+                        // never sit under the left view's edge
+                        .spacing(8)
                         .height(Length::Fill),
                 );
             }
